diff-line class check, per arm: every REMOVED line on all nine pass cells is
a vpiSize, a vpiConstType, a vpiDecompile or a value line (|DEC:/|OCT:);
UNEXPLAINED-REMOVALS=0 on all nine.  Everything else is ADD-only.

the three page-class arms move an address-derived UINT by exactly 4096:
  23237017 -> 23241113
16 KB PAD POSITIVE CONTROL (pristine + volatile char v89pad[16384], NO law code):
  23237017 -> 23253401  = +16384 EXACTLY, four times the law binary's page.
  The value tracks the LOADED IMAGE, not the emitter's semantics.
